`solution.md` (every `##` below is mandatory, in this order):
```markdown
# <proposal title>

## Agenda scope
agenda/category · WHEN→DO→GAIN recipe · clusters/areas it crosses

## Issue
<elaborated problem — step by step, where the waste is, when it bites, why at scale>

## Solution
<lever + new control/data flow + functions touched + pseudocode sketch>

## Mechanism
<physical reason for the gain, tied to throughput/TPOT/TTFT/memory>

## Similar PRs
<1-3 real merged PRs from this agenda, #numbers + their gains, + the analogy>

## Potential gain
<estimate SCALED from the cited prior PRs' gains × explained factor; range + confidence + assumptions>

